#: prefs.js:907
msgid "Kiwi"
msgstr "Kiwi"

#: prefs.js:908
msgid ""
"Kiwi is not like Apple, it's free open source project that brings macOS-like "
"feel for GNOME"
msgstr ""
"Kiwi n’est pas Apple ; c’est un projet libre et open source qui apporte une "
